Attribution:

- The Gauntlet Loop technique was created by Matt Shumer.
- Jay E at RoboNuggets packaged the technique as the Gauntlet Loop skill at https://github.com/robonuggets/gauntlet-loop.
- Bossfight is an adapted work. It replaces the prompt-only handoff with an executable dependency graph, deterministic gates, isolated state, resumable evidence, and automated agent evaluations.
- pstack by Lauren Tan informed the engineering principles. Bossfight does not copy pstack code.
